  "title": "American Express Formally Terminates Etihad Guest Transfer Partnership",
  "summary": "American Express has officially dropped Etihad Guest as a global Membership Rewards transfer partner effective June 30, 2026. While U.S. cardholders can no longer convert Amex points to Etihad at a 1:1 ratio, the airline program remains fully accessible via alternative transfer ecosystems including Capital One, Citi, and Bilt.",
